# Input

```scss
$gap:2px;
.box{width:attr(data-size px, $gap*2);height:attr(data-height type(<length>),($gap + 1px)*2);padding:attr(data-pad px,1px + $gap*2);margin:attr(data-pad px,var(--fallback,$gap*2));}
.native{content:attr(data-label);width:attr(data-size px,2px);height:attr(data-height type(<length>),2px);}
.empty{content:attr(data-label,);width:attr(data-size px,/* empty */);}
.comments{width:attr(data-size px/* comma */,/* expression */($gap + 1px)*2/* close */);}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$gap: 2px;
.box {
	width: attr(data-size px, $gap * 2);
	height: attr(data-height type(<length>), ($gap + 1px) * 2);
	padding: attr(data-pad px, 1px + $gap * 2);
	margin: attr(data-pad px, var(--fallback, $gap * 2));
}
.native {
	content: attr(data-label);
	width: attr(data-size px, 2px);
	height: attr(data-height type(<length>), 2px);
}
.empty {
	content: attr(data-label, );
	width: attr(data-size px, /* empty */);
}
.comments {
	width: attr(
		data-size
		px /* comma */,
		/* expression */ ($gap + 1px) * 2 /* close */
	);
}

```
